    {
      "id": "claim_dcc0df2d8d304d71876fefca31c6744e",
      "statement": "The Containerfile uses a digest-pinned, Renovate-managed UBI 9 base and defines five stages (tools-base, sre-tools, claude-builder, tmux-builder, final) where only final ships; sre-tools/claude-builder depend on tools-base while tmux-builder depends solely on BASE_IMAGE, so stages 2-5 can build in parallel under BuildKit/podman --layers except that final must still wait on the other three builder stages' copied outputs. The root Makefile's build-amd64/build-arm64 targets build AMD64/ARM64 variants with Podman while the manifest target combines their tags into one manifest list.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Containerfile#L1-L23",
