    {
      "id": "claim_e7155a2db30d4f658204f4639291bb01",
      "statement": "sre_tools.py (invoked from the Containerfile's sre-tools stage, with GITHUB_TOKEN and GitHub App secrets mounted) shells out to github_dl to fetch exact, architecture-named release assets for GitHub-hosted CLIs (ocm, ocm-backplane, osdctl, yq) while verifying aws and oc directly against GPG-signed manifests instead; github_dl prefers a GitHub App token when all three app secrets are present and otherwise falls back to GITHUB_TOKEN, and matches a checksum record to the requested asset and hashes the downloaded bytes before accepting them. verify_sre_tools.py combines the six per-tool inventories into tool-versions.json during the sre-tools stage and re-verifies the shipped filesystem offline as the sre user before the final image is tagged. Claude Code is fetched the same way via github_dl in the claude-builder stage, and tmux's source tarball is checked against a hard-coded SHA256 before compilation in the independent tmux-builder stage.",
